# Gradle wrapper IS committed so CI runners (which check out a clean
# tree) can invoke ./gradlew without bootstrapping. The .jar is ~60KB
# binary but the trade-off is worth it: workflow runs that need
# packageDmg / packageMsi need a runnable wrapper from minute zero.

# macOS noise
.DS_Store

# Signing artifacts — never commit
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
